---

## What Is OmniAskAI?

OmniAskAI is a consumer-facing knowledge product built on top of **AI Platform Engine (APE / RAG Builder)**.

Its core idea:

> **Each topic is a curated knowledge world with its own trusted sources, context, visual identity, and experience — not an empty generic chatbot.**

Example topics may include:

* Bangladesh Income Tax
* Laws and regulations
* Business guidance
* Literature
* Bangladesh History
* Movies and culture

Primary experience:

```text
Discover topic
   ↓
Enter knowledge workspace
   ↓
Ask / continue conversation
   ↓
Grounded answer
   ↓
Inspect citations / evidence
   ↓
Follow-up naturally
```

---

## Why It Exists

General AI tools are broad. OmniAskAI focuses on **curated, trustworthy, domain-specific knowledge experiences**, especially where local context, authoritative sources, Bangla/English/Banglish support, and citations matter.

Long-term product value comes from:

```text
Curated knowledge
→ trustworthy experience
→ repeated usage
→ premium knowledge/features
→ subscription
```

---

## Relationship With APE

APE is the reusable AI infrastructure platform already running at:

```text
https://api.omniaskai.com
```

APE owns:

```text
ingestion
→ OCR / parsing
→ chunking
→ embeddings
→ hybrid retrieval
→ reranking
→ grounding
→ generation
→ citations
→ evaluation
```

OmniAskAI owns the **consumer product layer**:

```text
topics
UI / UX
users
history
bookmarks
admin
subscriptions
analytics
SEO
business rules
topic routing
```

Do not duplicate RAG or AI infrastructure inside OmniAskAI.

APE is intentionally designed so external applications retain their own users, UI and business workflows while APE provides project-scoped AI capabilities.

---

## Application Shape

OmniAskAI starts as one cohesive **Next.js full-stack application**.

```text
Browser
   ↓
OmniAskAI — Next.js
├── public / SEO experience
├── topic workspace
├── conversation UI
├── product data
├── admin / auth / subscriptions
└── server-side APE integration
         ↓
        APE
```

APE credentials remain server-side.

```text
Browser
→ Next.js server
→ APE
```

The browser must never receive privileged APE Organization credentials. 

---

## Topic vs APE Project

An OmniAskAI **Topic** is a product concept.

An APE **Project** is a knowledge/RAG boundary.

Keep them separate:

```text
OmniAskAI Topic
       ↓
Knowledge Mapping
       ↓
APE Project(s)
```

Initially this may simply be:

```text
1 Topic → 1 APE Project
```

but do not hard-couple the concepts.

---

## Product Experience Direction

Current visual direction is defined by the approved landing-page and conversation-workspace concepts.

Key principles:

* premium, calm and spacious
* topic discovery over generic chatbot UX
* conversation remains the primary experience
* editorial-style grounded answers
* citations and evidence easy to inspect
* topic identity without redesigning the whole product
* minimal dashboard clutter
* strong responsive/mobile experience
* public topic content should support SEO and discovery

